PQ(SPG, '2023T1q1', 23, 1, 'mcq', { fam: "g-teamdyn",
  cs: ["team-dynamics"],
  week: 1,
  diff: "moderate",
  q: "<p>Consider the following:</p><p>Which of the “Scenario” depicted above aptly match the “Challenges” mentioned against each?</p>",
  opts: ["1 only", "2 only", "Both 1 and 2", "Neither 1 nor 2"],
  ans: 2,
  why: ["False: pair 2 is also accepted by the key.", "False: pair 1 is also accepted by the key.", "True (official key): both pairings are treated as matching.", "False."],
  sol: "<p>Self-interested bias signals a trust problem (pair 1). Magnified group bias produces conflict and tension between views (pair 2). The key accepts both → <b>Both 1 and 2</b>.</p>",
  trap: "Pair 2 looks loose (bias → conflict); the key still counts it.",
  block: {"id": "T", "text": "<table class=\"t\"><tr><th></th><th>Scenario</th><th>Challenge</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Ask whether the team’s recommendations contain self-interested biases</td><td>Lack of honesty and trust</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Biases are magnified when a team makes a decision collectively</td><td>Conflict and tension</td></tr></table><p class=\"small muted\">Typed from the image in the paper.</p>"} });
