  diff: "moderate",
  q: "<p>During a project pitch to executive stakeholders, a presenter notices that their voice is speeding up rapidly. To compensate, they speak continuously without pauses, fearing that any silence will make them appear unprepared or hesitant. According to the communication principles discussed in the course, how does the absence of pauses impact the presentation’s effectiveness?</p>",
