  cs: ["ei-goleman"],
  week: 5,
  diff: "easy",
  q: "<p>[EI Constructs] Kashish is an ML engineer who is passionate about her work and engages in goal- directed behaviour. She remains optimistic and resilient in the face of challenges and setbacks both in her personal and professional life. Kashish also actively seeks feedback and learning opportunities to improve her skills. Which construct of emotional intelligence does Kashish demonstrate?</p>",
