  why: ["False: adopting Y’s practices.", "False: each side giving something up.", "True: a hybrid that synthesises both strengths.", "False: parochialism is a narrow outlook, not a strategy."],
  sol: "<p>A new model combining consensus-building (Y) with rapid execution (X) → <b>cultural synergy</b>.</p>",
